@startuml state
title State Diagram - Payment request
skinparam shadowing false

[*] --> CREATED : POST /payments

CREATED --> WALLET_FOUND : wallet exists
CREATED --> FAILED : WALLET_NOT_FOUND

WALLET_FOUND --> CLIENT_VERIFIED : ABC returned active client
WALLET_FOUND --> FAILED : CLIENT_NOT_FOUND /\nCLIENT_BLOCKED /\nCLIENT_SERVICE_UNAVAILABLE

CLIENT_VERIFIED --> FUNDS_CONFIRMED : balance >= amount
CLIENT_VERIFIED --> FAILED : INSUFFICIENT_FUNDS

FUNDS_CONFIRMED --> PROCESSING : transaction broadcast (tx_id)
FUNDS_CONFIRMED --> FAILED : WALLET_ERROR

PROCESSING --> SUCCESS : confirmations >= required
PROCESSING --> FAILED : TRANSACTION_REJECTED

SUCCESS --> [*]
FAILED --> [*]

note right of PROCESSING
  Money has left the client's wallet
  and is waiting to be confirmed in a block.
end note
note bottom of FAILED
  Final state. failure_reason says why.
end note
@enduml
